  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Patients&#xb4;appeal for palliative care</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Patients&#xb4;appeal for palliative care</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13e;om mikrograntu je zlep&#x161;i&#x165; kvalitu &#x17e;ivota nevylie&#x10d;ite&#x13e;ne chor&#xfd;ch onkologick&#xfd;ch pacientov v meste Tirana a Durres a taktie&#x17e; zv&#xfd;&#x161;i&#x165; informovanos&#x165; o paliat&#xed;vnej starostlivosti v krajine prostredn&#xed;ctvom dvoch kampan&#xed;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to improve the quality of life of terminally ill cancer patients in Tirana and Durres and also to raise awareness about palliative care in the country by preparing two campaigns.</narrative>
  </description>
